      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hesekia akololosia limenya lie dini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga naikara eya e Pasaka ne yawa, Baisiraeli boosi ba baaba mu Yerusalemu barura bacha mu ngoba cha Yuda. Ebweeneyo batechulaka chinjeko mala baremaka sifwaani sia wele Asherimu. Bonakaka abuundu aesuta ne chi alutare che khusaayilakho wele babaandi mu Yuda mwoosi, Benjamini, Efuraimu ne Manase. Nio enyuma ne bamalile khukhwonakaka bioosi, Baisiraeli abo bakobola mu ngoba chabwe ne mu chingo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Hesekia arobora bipupu bie basaayi ne Balawi abara khu milimo, buli omusaayi ne omulawi khuloondekhana ne kimilimo kiewe. Bipupu bino biaananga biianwa bie khukhwosia ne biianwa bie kumuleembe, ne khukhola kimilimo mu bilibwa bie chikambi cha Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ne khusiima ne khufumia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Khub. 28.1—29.39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hesekia aana bibiaayo khukhwama mwituuli liewe omwene khulwe biianwa bie khukhwosia. Biianwa bie khukhwosia bino biaba bie kumutikhinyi ne ekolooba, ne chindaalo che Sabato, khu siise sie kumwesi kumuya ne khulwe chinaikara, nga liaandikwa mu lilaka lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
