          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.12+NUM.18.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 18.12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hesekia aalaka babaandu ba baamenya mu Yerusalemu baelesie basaayi ne Balawi sitonyi siabwe, nio basaayi ne Balawi baane biise biabwe khu Lilaka lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Baisiraeli banyoola lilaka lia Hesekia busa liri, baana mu bukali biakhulia biabwe bie khunyoa, endali, kamafura, bubuukhi nende buli siindu nisio basaasianga mu mikuunda. Bareera sitonyi silala khwikhumi eya buli siindu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne babaandu ba Isiraeli ne Yuda ba baamenya mu Yuda bosi bareera sitonyi silala khwikhumi sie chikhaafu ne kamakheese ne sitonyi silala khuwikhumi sie bibiindu bitakatifu bibiaanwa khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wabwe mala babira bioosi bieema kumweeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwesi kukhola khataru barakikha khubuusia biianwa bie sitonyi silala khwikhumi ne biianwa bibiindi. Bamala khubuusia mu mwesi kwa saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Hesekia ne babemeelesi bewe becha mala babona bituumi, bafumia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne babaandu bewe, Baisiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekia areeba basaayi ne Balawi khuloondekhana ne bituumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaria, Omusaayi Omukhulu Lukali, khukhwama munju eya Satoki akobosia Hesekia ali, “Khukhwama nga babaandu ne barakikha khureera biianwa biabwe mu nju ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi efwe khwabeele ne biakhulia bikali. Ne bikali khu biakhulia bino biaramire sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi abiitile babaandu bewe chikhabi. Nono khuli ne nabino bioosi biramire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Hesekia alaka barekekhe chisiro mu nju ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Bakhola bario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bareera mu bwiyikinwa biianwa ne bibiindu bibiaanwa khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne sitonyi silala khwikhumi. Konania, Omulawi aaba niye omwimeelesi omukhulu owe bibiindu bino, ne Shimei wandaaye niye owamuloondela mu bwimeelesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babayeetanga Konania ne Shimei baba babemeelesi, Yehieli, Asasia, Nahati, Asaheli, Yeremoti, Yosabati, Elieli, Isimakia, Mahati, ne Benaya. Omwami Hesekia ne Asaria Omusaayi Omukhulu Lukali, owe nju eya Wele barobora babaandu bano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kore okhwa Imuna Omulawi, omuliindi owe silibwa sie Bukwe, aaba omwimeelesi owe biianwa bie khukhwiaana khu Wele. Kumulimo kwewe kwaba khuaana biaanilwe khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne biianwa bitakatifu lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edeni, Miniamini, Yeshwa, Shemaya, Amaria, ne Shekania bayeetanga Kore mu bweyikinwa mu ngoba nimwo basaayi bamenyanga. Baananga khukhwama mu biaanilwe khu basaayi, baele ne basaakhulu sitube.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu biaba ne biaanilwe, babaandu bano lundi baelesia basoleeli be bukhulu bwe kimiiko kitaru namwe khukhilakhoo, babaandikwa mu ngano che lisaaye lie Balawi. Basoleeli bano bengilanga mu nju ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khulwe kimilimo kiabwe kia buli ndaalo, buli sipupu ne kimilimo kiasio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basaayi baelesibwa bitonyi bie biianwa khuloondekhana ne chinju chabwe. Balawi be bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kabili ne khukhilakho baelesibwa bitonyi khuloondekhana ne kimilimo kiabwe ne bipupu biabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basaayi baebwa siakhulia siabwe nende sie babaana babwe bakeekhe, bakhasi, basoleeli, ne bakhaana boosi. Lino liakholekha sikila basaayi be lisaaye lia Aruni baba babeyikinwa mu khwitakaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balala khu be lisaaye lia Aruni bamenyanga mu mikuunda embi ne chingoba namwe mungoba. Babaandu baroborwa khuloondekhana ne kamasina khuaana siakhulia khu basaayi bano ne khu buli omulawi owaandikwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko omwami Hesekia akhola mu Yuda mwoosi. Aakhola kaali kamalayi ne kamaluungi nende ke bubwiyikinwa ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kumulimo nikwo Hesekia akhola khulwe enju eya Wele ne niko akhola khukhwichusia kamalaka ka Wele, ne asaaya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, akhola ne kumwoyo kwewe kwoosi, mala aindiaala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
